    "title": "Benny Blanco Told Hunter Biden He Could Be a Model. Hunter Had Another Line of Work in Mind - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Nadia Santiago ,\nnow On his podcast, Benny Blanco told Hunter Biden : “You should model.”\nHunter: “Are you saying I should do OnlyFans? I could put up all my old stuff on the Only Fans.”\nGesturing animatedly from a living room couch, a silver-haired man in a denim shirt sits beside a basketball plush toy, with a large giraffe stuffed animal visible behind him. Credit: Friends Keep Secrets. Music producer Benny Blanco hosts a podcast called Friends Keep Secrets. During his episode with Hunter Biden, he started in on the compliments, telling Hunter he had the looks and the style to model.\nHunter’s counteroffer was OnlyFans. He joked that he already had old material ready to post, a knowing wink at the intimate photos that leaked back in 2020.\nA curly-haired young man in a white tee and gold chains grins on a couch, holding a plush baguette, with a colorful bookshelf behind him. Credit: Friends Keep Secrets. Nobody’s actually launching anything. He got a compliment and turned it into a joke about his own past.\nThank you for reading. You can find Thought Catalog on Facebook , and read more over on our website .",
    "summary": "I could put up all my old stuff on the Only Fans.” Gesturing animatedly from a living room couch, a silver-haired man in a denim shirt sits beside a basketball plush toy, with a large giraffe stuffed animal visible behind him. Music producer Benny Blanco hosts a podcast called Friends Keep Secrets. He joked that he already had old material ready to post, a knowing wink at the intimate photos that leaked back in 2020. A curly-haired young man in a white tee and gold chains grins on a couch, holding a plush baguette, with a colorful bookshelf behind him.",
